@AnyChat.NET.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249

GET {{AnyChat.NET.Api_HostAddress}}/api/spaces
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{AnyChat.NET.Api_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}/chats
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{AnyChat.NET.Api_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{AnyChat.NET.Api_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?limit=10&beforeOrderId={{oldestOrderId}}
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{AnyChat.NET.Api_HostAddress}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello from AnyChat"
}

###
